                  "description": "(Required) The name of the Auto Scaling group.",
                  "key": "AutoScalingGroupName",
                  "value": "<string>"
                },
                {
                  "description": "(Required) The Amazon Resource Names (ARNs) of the target groups. You can specify up to 10 target groups. To get the ARN of a target group, use the Elastic Load Balancing <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/APIReference/API_DescribeTargetGroups.html\">DescribeTargetGroups</a> API operation.",
                  "key": "TargetGroupARNs",
                  "value": "<string>"
                },
                {
                  "description": "(Required) The Amazon Resource Names (ARNs) of the target groups. You can specify up to 10 target groups. To get the ARN of a target group, use the Elastic Load Balancing <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/APIReference/API_DescribeTargetGroups.html\">DescribeTargetGroups</a> API operation.",
                  "key": "TargetGroupARNs",
